                        "glosses": [
                            "Not transferred by deed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "04281d04-4583-47e2-baf4-06893b433ce7",
                                "sense_id": "3c9de9f6-18dc-3aa8-8b93-5d4bc2c5a560",
                                "text": "undeeded land"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea60e95d-09ba-4577-a0b0-5b1f2093f14c",
                                "sense_id": "3c9de9f6-18dc-3aa8-8b93-5d4bc2c5a560",
                                "text": "First, has the legislature of the territory attempted to make such undeeded lots, pending contest, subject to taxation?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39bc5813-f597-46c3-aeb0-86b43ccbf02e",
                                "sense_id": "3c9de9f6-18dc-3aa8-8b93-5d4bc2c5a560",
                                "text": "It should be noted that neither of these letters written by the White House staff referred to any portion of the undeeded papers as a gift to the United States, nor do they indicate an intent at that time to treat any portion of those papers as a gift."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b3352de-e385-4b70-8bcd-3180ca581faa",
                                "sense_id": "3c9de9f6-18dc-3aa8-8b93-5d4bc2c5a560",
                                "text": "In North Elba, the Hendersons, Jeffersons, Carasaws, Wortses, Fraziers, Halls, Thompsons, and Browns all chose to farm on undeeded land."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2d88b3ce-3320-3dea-9cd3-207f78962e56",
                        "entry_id": "7341efb9-4453-3d59-95e7-f3600d80cb4d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not made famous or marked by any great action."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "obsolete",
                            "poetic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6cc84b6-9815-4c43-bbd3-566fa68383ae",
                                "sense_id": "2d88b3ce-3320-3dea-9cd3-207f78962e56",
                                "text": "Or else my sword, with an unbatter'd edge, I sheathe again undeeded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c198ee87-7477-4b88-8879-c410ffe6dee3",
                                "sense_id": "2d88b3ce-3320-3dea-9cd3-207f78962e56",
                                "text": "The hand of truthful Time, which obscures the rays of the undeeded sceptre, and dulls the whiteness of the robe of hereditary ermine, approaches but to tinge with brighter hue the green and living freshness of the poet's, or the hero's laurel!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "863ab798-a6f9-4c8a-ad5e-ebb0564ca280",
                                "sense_id": "2d88b3ce-3320-3dea-9cd3-207f78962e56",
                                "text": "Now their deeds are left undeeded, Buried 'neath unhallowed laws; Now their names are only needed As a watchword of applause."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ac57c9e-6ce3-42ec-b6c1-9d6cca7187f0",
                                "sense_id": "2d88b3ce-3320-3dea-9cd3-207f78962e56",
                                "text": "No return will ever come from undeeded lust in proposal"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
